Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Naya loan 8.51 percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,aapka purana loan abhi bhi 8.96?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,RBI data:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,September mein naye loan saste hue,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,purane wahin atke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wajah?
